• What modular interfaces would allow seamless reconfiguration while maintaining structural integrity?
• How can we design reconfiguration options that are discoverable without overwhelming users with complexity?
• Which components are most valuable to make interchangeable based on likely changes in user needs?
• What documentation and visual systems would guide users through reconfiguration possibilities?
• How can reconfigurable design support repair and refurbishment workflows in product recovery?
• What business model changes are needed to support product reconfiguration at scale?